WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.300
Hey kids — have you heard about this place?

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:04.620
This neighborhood grew up around Union College.

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:07.960
Look — the red-brick halls around the green quad!

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:09.410
The campus is still its heart.
